2Ki 15:1 , Azariah's good reign;
2Ki 15:5 , He dying a leper, Jotham succeeds;
2Ki 15:8 , Zachariah the last of Jehu's generation, reigning ill, is slain by Shallum;
2Ki 15:13 , Shallum, reigning a month, is slain by Menahem;
2Ki 15:16 , Menahem strengthens himself by Pul;
2Ki 15:21 , Pekahiah succeeds him;
2Ki 15:23 , Pekahiah is slain by Pekah;
2Ki 15:27 , Pekah is oppressed by Tiglath-pileser, and slain by Hoshea;
2Ki 15:32 , Jotham's good reign;
2Ki 15:36 , Ahaz succeeds him.
